"Creates a separate PDF. Page annotations and retained link destinations are preserved. Interactive forms, document scripts, and document structure are removed. Existing encryption is kept." = "Membuat PDF terpisah. Anotasi halaman dan tujuan tautan yang dipertahankan tetap disertakan. Formulir interaktif, skrip dokumen, dan struktur dokumen dihapus. Enkripsi yang ada dipertahankan.";
